
  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ 1. HERO ============ -->
    <section class="hero ai-hero" aria-labelledby="heroTitle">
      <div class="container hero__inner ai-hero__grid">
        <div class="ai-hero__top">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI that does the admin<span class="hide-sm"> · for teams of 5 to 200</span></span>
          <h1 id="heroTitle">Your business shouldn&rsquo;t have to <em>work this hard.</em></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <p class="lead hero__say">AI can now read your emails, documents and invoices and do the typing your team does by hand. <b>A person still checks it.</b></p>
          <div class="btn-row hero__cta">
            <a href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-hero-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
            <a href="ai-demos" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-hero-examples">See it work</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__visual ai-hero__visual">
          <figure class="hv reveal" data-hv aria-label="Examples of an AI system at work: an incoming item is read and a ready-to-approve result is prepared, with the time saved per item.">
            <div class="hv__bar">
              <span class="hv__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              <div class="hv__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Examples">
                <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-hv-tab="0">Enquiries<i></i></button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-hv-tab="1">Documents<i></i></button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-hv-tab="2">Invoices<i></i></button>
              </div>
              <span class="hv__tag">Example</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hv__body" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="hv__in">
                <span class="hv__label" data-hv-from>New email</span>
                <p data-hv-msg>Hi, we&rsquo;re buying a house for R2.4m and need transfer done before 30 November. What do you charge, and what do you need from us?</p>
              </div>
              <div class="hv__flow" aria-hidden="true"><span data-hv-step>AI read it · checked your fee schedule · drafted the reply</span></div>
              <div class="hv__out">
                <div class="hv__outhead"><span class="hv__label hv__label--ok" data-hv-outlabel>Ready for approval</span><span class="hv__ai">Done by AI in seconds</span></div>
                <dl class="hv__fields" data-hv-fields><div><dt>Service</dt><dd>Property transfer</dd></div><div><dt>Value</dt><dd>R2.4m</dd></div><div><dt>Deadline</dt><dd>30 Nov</dd></div></dl>
                <p class="hv__draft" data-hv-draft>Thank you for your enquiry. For a R2.4m transfer our fees are R38,950 incl. VAT; to start we need&hellip;</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption class="hv__foot">
              <span class="hv__metric"><s data-hv-before>~15 min</s> <b data-hv-after>~3 min</b></span>
              <span class="hv__caption" data-hv-metric>per enquiry, prepared for a person to approve</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="container">
        <ul class="assure reveal" aria-label="How we work">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b>Fixed proposal</b> before any development</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b>Measured</b> before and after, reported monthly</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b>You own</b> the code, the accounts and the data</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b>A person approves</b> anything that matters</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 2. RECOGNISE THE PROBLEM ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="make-easier" aria-labelledby="easierTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Start with the problem</span>
          <h2 id="easierTitle">What would you like to make easier?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-grid">
          <a class="prob reveal" href="ai-for-business#library" data-track="problem-save-time"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 7v5l3 2M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18z"/></svg></span><b>Save time</b><span>Less admin and manual work.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <a class="prob reveal" href="services#websites" data-track="problem-customers"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19l5-6 4 3 7-9M15 7h5v5"/></svg></span><b>Get more customers</b><span>More enquiries, answered faster.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <a class="prob reveal" href="services#dashboards" data-track="problem-numbers"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"/></svg></span><b>Understand your numbers</b><span>All your numbers in one place.</span><i>See how &rarr;</i></a>
          <button type="button" class="prob reveal" data-review-open data-review-goal="Improve how my business works" data-track="problem-improve"><span class="prob__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4v5h5M20 20v-5h-5M4.5 9A8 8 0 0 1 19 7M19.5 15A8 8 0 0 1 5 17"/></svg></span><b>Improve how your business works</b><span>Fix a process that takes too long.</span><i>Tell us about it &rarr;</i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 3. SHOW WHAT'S POSSIBLE ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="examples" aria-labelledby="exTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Try them</span>
          <h2 id="exTitle">See it work.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-grid">
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Enquiries</span>
            <h3>Enquiries handled</h3>
            <p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Calls and emails get lost or answered late.</s> Every one captured, with the reply ready.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="ai-demos#calls" data-track="demo-open-enquiry">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Numbers</span>
            <h3>A business dashboard</h3>
            <p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Numbers spread across spreadsheets.</s> One screen, kept up to date.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="demos#sales-dashboard" data-track="demo-open-dashboard">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal">
            <span class="ex-card__k">Knowledge</span>
            <h3>Answers from your documents</h3>
            <p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Staff dig through files or ask the one person who knows.</s> Answers from your documents, with the source.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="ai-demos#rag" data-track="demo-open-knowledge">Try it &rarr;</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="ai-demos" data-track="cta-all-examples">See all the examples</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 4. PRICING & PROCESS ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricingTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
          <h2 id="pricingTitle">Clear prices. Fixed before we start.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="pp reveal">
          <div>
            <div class="pp-ex">
              <span class="pp-ex__k">Typical project</span>
              <p><b><span data-zar="120000">R120,000</span></b> to build, <b><span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/month</b> to run, <b>208 hours</b> back a month. <b>Paid off in about <span data-payback>3</span> months.</b></p>
              <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#roi" data-track="cta-home-roi">Work out yours &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <p class="cur-line">Prices in <span class="cur-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show prices in"><button type="button" data-cur="ZAR" aria-pressed="true">ZAR</button><button type="button" data-cur="USD" aria-pressed="false">USD</button><button type="button" data-cur="EUR" aria-pressed="false">EUR</button><button type="button" data-cur="GBP" aria-pressed="false">GBP</button></span></p>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span class="pl-name">AI solutions</span><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Automations</span><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Dashboards</span><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Custom software</span><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></span></li>
              <li><span class="pl-name">Websites</span><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Starting prices. Your fixed quote, with every monthly cost, comes before any work.</p>
          </div>
          <ol class="pp-steps">
            <li><span><b>Tell us the problem</b></span></li>
            <li><span><b>Get a fixed quote</b></span></li>
            <li><span><b>We build, you review</b></span></li>
            <li><span><b>It goes live</b>, and we measure the time saved</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing" data-track="cta-pricing">All prices</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 5. FINAL CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Not sure what you need? That&rsquo;s fine.</h2>
        <p>Tell us what takes too long. We&rsquo;ll suggest the simplest fix.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-final-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large" data-review-open>Or tell us in writing</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted cta__paths">Know what you want? <a class="inline-link" href="start" data-track="cta-final-estimate">Get an estimate</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

